<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHP" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Filipikailu Suran</para>
  <para style="toc3">PHP</para>
  <para style="toc1">Filipikailu</para>
  <para style="toc2">FIL</para>
  <para style="mt1">Filipikailu</para>
  <para style="mt2">Pɔli Alla la Kuma Mɛn Nawa Filipikailu Ma</para>
  <para style="ip">Isa la Talibidenba Pɔli le Alla la kuma ɲin sɛbɛni Isa la mɔɔilu ma mɛnilu ye siini Filipe so kɔndɔ. Waati taminilu, Pɔli tɛrɛ ra kawandili bɔ ye. Ii lemɛniya ka sabati kosɛbɛ, haan ka Pɔli dɛmɛn a baara ri yɔrɔ gbɛrɛ la. Wo bɛɛ ɲabɔni Keladenilu Kɛwaliilu kitabu yɔrɔ kɔndɔ a suran 16.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pɔli ye wa Romi kaso la a lemɛniya la ko rɔ, Alla ka a kɛ a ye kitabu sɛbɛ lemɛniya jamailu ma. Pɔli ka kitabu kelen sɛbɛ Filipikailu ma. A ka ii lalemɛniya kosa ii ye to Alla sawo kɔndɔ, ii fanan ye kɛ misali ɲuma ri mɛn di se a kɛla mɔɔ gbɛrɛ ye bila Isa kɔfɛ. Pɔli ka a labila ii ma ko ii ti se ii jɛrɛ kisila ii baara ɲumailu fɛ, fɔɔ Isa baraka rɔ mɛn a jɛrɛ bɔni sarakayala dunuɲa bɛɛ yɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Talibidenba Pɔli ka Isa la ko Kibaro Ɲuma kawandili bɔ le Filipe so kɔndɔ Kirikailu jamana rɔ, a ka lemɛniya jama ladɛn damira ye a kelaya taama filana le (Keladenilu Kɛwaliilu suran 16 kuma diya 12 haan 24 ragbɛ). San dɔndɔ taminni, a ye kaso la waati mɛn na (Filipikailu suran 1 kuma diya 7 ragbɛ), Talibidenba Pɔli ka badenmaya sɛbɛ sɛbɛ Filipikailu ma. A ye a fɛ ii nuwali la ko fen ba la ko rɔ ii tɛrɛ ra mɛnilu lana a ma don Epaforodite bolo, ale jɛrɛ ka tɔrɔya waati mɛn na. A fanan ye a fɛ le a ye a fɔ ii yɛ ko ii ri ii fanka don ii ri a telen Alla la Ɲenematɔmɔnin ɲa kɔrɔ. Ii fanan kana kunfan wuya dinailu fɛ mɛnilu ye ii jamana rɔ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabu yɔrɔ ɲin damira (suran 1 kuma diya 1 haan 11), Pɔli ka a sɛwa ni a waliɲuma lɔn de jirakala Filipe lemɛniya mɔɔilu la. Wo kɔ rɔ, a ka a jɛrɛ ɲa ɲafɔ. A ka jususuma mɛn sɔrɔn Isa baraka rɔ, a ka wo yiraka hali a tɛ a lɔn Romukailu ye mɛn kɛla a la kaso la. (Filipikailu suran 1 kuma diya 12 haan 26) A ka ii kawandi ko ii ye to lemɛniya bɛrɛ rɔ, ka bɛn ladon ii tɛma, ka kolo ii ɲɔɔn ma, nii ɲuma tora ii bolo mɛn bɔni Isa ma (suran 1 kuma diya 27 haan suran 2 kuma diya 18). Yani ii fanan ka ii ɲɔɔn yen, Pɔli ka a fɔ, a ye Filipikailu keladen Epaforodite ni Pɔli kɔfɛbilailu Timote ye to ii ni Filipikailu tɛma (Suran 2 kuma diya 19 haan 30).</para>
  <para style="ip">Wo kɔ rɔ, Pɔli ka ii lalɔn mɔɔilu ko ma mɛnilu tɛ telenni Isa la ko Kibaro Ɲuma yɛ. A ka a fɔ Filipikailu yɛ ko ii ye to ikomin ale, ka ii fanka don lemɛniya rɔ, ii tora ikomin Isa (Filipikailu suran 3). Kitabu yɔrɔ ɲin rajanni kawandi siyaman de ma ii ni nuwali bɔlailu ni tuwaliilu (Filipikailu suran 4). Ye, Isa la mɔɔilu ye nɔ lemɛniya sɔrɔn Kitabu yɔrɔ ɲin fɛ.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHP 1" />
  <para style="s">Tuwaliilu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 1:1" />Nde Pɔli ni Timote, Ɲenematɔmɔnin Isa la baarakɛlailu, an ka ɲin de sɛbɛ ka a lawa aile Ɲenematɔmɔnin na jama sɛniman ma mɛnilu ye Filipi so kɔndɔ a ni dina kuntiilu ni dɛmɛnninnailu. <verse eid="PHP 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 1:2" />An Fa Alla ni Maari Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin ye hina ni jususuma di ai ma.<verse eid="PHP 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔli la Alla matara Filipe lemɛniya mɔɔilu yɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 1:3" />Ai la ko wa labila n ma waati si la, n di baraka bila Alla yɛ. <verse eid="PHP 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 1:4" />N ye Alla matarala ai yɛ sɛwa le rɔ waati bɛɛ, <verse eid="PHP 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 1:5" />ka a masɔrɔn ai ra n dɛmɛn Isa la ko Kibaro Ɲuma lase diya ka bɔ lon fɔlɔ ma haan bi. <verse eid="PHP 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 1:6" />N lani a la fewu, Alla mɛn ka baara ɲuma ɲin damira ai tɛma, a ri a lakanbali haan a la Ɲenematɔmɔnin Isa na lon. <verse eid="PHP 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 1:7" />A bɛnnin ai bɛɛ la diyaɲɛ ye to n dɔ ɲa kelen dɔ, ka a masɔrɔn ai la ko lamarani n jusu rɔ. Baa ni n sidinin jɔlɔkɔ la, wala ni n ye Isa la ko Kibaro Ɲuma kɛlɛ kɛla, ka a ɲabɔ, an bɛɛ ye Alla la sɔli rɔ. <verse eid="PHP 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 1:8" />Alla le n sere ri ko ai la lɔɔ ye n na kaninteya bɛrɛ rɔ mɛn bɔni Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin jɛrɛ rɔ.<verse eid="PHP 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 1:9" />N na Alla matarali le ɲin di: Ai la kaninteya ye makafu fewu, lɔnnin ni famunyali bɛrɛ la, <verse eid="PHP 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 1:10" />kosa ai ye se ko fisamantɛ lɔnna, ka to fɛɛtanya ni joo korontanya rɔ haan Ɲenematɔmɔnin na lon. <verse eid="PHP 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 1:11" />Ai ye dafa telenbaya jiriden dɔ mɛnilu ye bɔla Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin dɔ, Alla gbiliya ko ni a bato ko rɔ.<verse eid="PHP 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔli ye kaso la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 1:12" />N badenmailu, n ye a fɛ le, ai ye a lɔn ko mɛnilu kɛra n na, woilu ra Isa la ko Kibaro Ɲuma dɛmɛn, ka wa ɲafɛ. <verse eid="PHP 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 1:13" />Ka a masɔrɔn a ra yiraka mansa la bɔlɔn kɔnɔgbɛnna bɛɛ ni mɔɔilu bɛɛ la, ko n ye kaso la Ɲenematɔmɔnin de la ko rɔ, <verse eid="PHP 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 1:14" />Badenma siyaman, mɛnilu ka ii la landaya la Maari rɔ, baa n bilanin kaso la, woilu ra wakali sɔrɔn Alla la kuma lase diya kosɛbɛ, ii ma silan.<verse eid="PHP 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 1:15" />Tuɲa le wo ri, ii le doilu ye Ɲenematɔmɔnin na ko kawandili bɔla minlɛ ni bɛnbaliya le rɔ, kɔni doilu ye a kɛla wɔnike ɲumaya le rɔ. <verse eid="PHP 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 1:16" />Woilu ye a kɛla kaninteya le rɔ, ka a masɔrɔn ii ka a lɔn ko Alla ka n lɔ yan Isa la ko Kibaro Ɲuma la kɛlɛ kɛ ko le rɔ. <verse eid="PHP 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 1:17" />Doilu ye Ɲenematɔmɔnin na ko kawandili bɔla nata le rɔ. Ii miriyailu ma ɲin. Ii mirinin ko ii ye do lala n na tɔrɔya kan kaso la.<verse eid="PHP 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 1:18" />Foyi tɛ wo ri. Ni ii miriya kɛra a ɲuma ri, ni a kɛra juuman di, Ɲenematɔmɔnin na ko ra lase ɲa bɛɛ ma. Wo ra n sɛwa, n di to sɛwa rɔ fanan. <verse eid="PHP 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 1:19" />Ka a masɔrɔn n ka a lɔn ko wo bɛɛ ye kɛla n na kisi le ri ai la Alla mataraliilu ni Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin na Nii baraka le rɔ. <verse eid="PHP 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 1:20" />N ye mɛn makɔnɔla, ka n jii la a rɔ ko n kana maloya ko si sɔrɔn muumɛ. Kɔni n ye lala a la ten ikomin waati taminniilu rɔ kosa Ɲenematɔmɔnin di gbiliya n faribanku rɔ, ni n tora n nii la, wala ni n faara. <verse eid="PHP 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 1:21" />Ka a masɔrɔn Ɲenematɔmɔnin de kɛni nde la dunuɲaratɛɛ ri, ka saya kɛ tɔnɔ ri n yɛ.<verse eid="PHP 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 1:22" />Kɔni ni n tora nii la faribanku rɔ, n di se baara tɔnɔma do kɛla. N ka kan n ye nfen kɛ? N ma a lɔn. <verse eid="PHP 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 1:23" />N gbɛrɛnni ko fila ɲin bɛɛ la: N ye a fɛ ka bɔ dunuɲa ɲin dɔ, ka wa to Ɲenematɔmɔnin tɔrɔfɛ, wo le ka fisa kosɛbɛ. <verse eid="PHP 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 1:24" />Kɔni ai le la ko rɔ, a bɛnnin n ye to n nii la faribanku rɔ. <verse eid="PHP 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 1:25" />Baa n lani wo la, n da a lɔn ko n di to ai tɛma kosa ai ye wa ɲafɛ, ka sɛwa ai la lemɛniya rɔ. <verse eid="PHP 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 1:26" />Kosa n wa n kɔsɛ ai tɔrɔfɛ tuma mɛn na, ai ri Ɲenematɔmɔnin Isa matɔɔ makafu n na ko rɔ.<verse eid="PHP 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 1:27" />Kɔni, ai taama ɲa ye bɛn Ɲenematɔmɔnin na Kibaro Ɲuma ma, wo rɔ ni n di na ai tɔrɔfɛ, wala ni n ye jan, n ye a mɛn de ko ai ye to hankili kelen dɔ, ko ai ye ai bolo don ai ɲɔɔn bolo ka Kibaro Ɲuma lase lemɛniya rɔ. <verse eid="PHP 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 1:28" />Ai kana silan ai kɛlɛɲɔɔilu ɲɛrɔ muumɛ! Wo ye a yirakala ii la le ko ii ri halaki, kɔni ai le ri kisi Alla baraka rɔ. <verse eid="PHP 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 1:29" />Baa a ra a sɔn a la hina rɔ ko ai ye la Ɲenematɔmɔnin na, wo kelen tɛ kɔni ka tɔrɔ a la ko rɔ fanan, <verse eid="PHP 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 1:30" />ai ye to wo kɛlɛ kelen donna, ai ka n yen mɛn donna, ikomin ai ra a mɛn ɲa mɛn ma, haan sisɛn n ye wo kan.<verse eid="PHP 1:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PHP 2" />
  <para style="s">Isa ladɛn ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 2:1" />Wo rɔ, ni Ɲenematɔmɔnin ye fanka si dila ai ma, wala ni a la kaninteya ye masabarili si dila ai ma, wala ni bɛn si ye ai ni Alla la Nii Sɛniman tɛma, wala ni kaninteya ni kininkinin si ye ai rɔ, <verse eid="PHP 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 2:2" />nba, ai ye n na sɛwa lakanbali, ka bɛn ai ɲɔɔn ma, ka kaninteya kelen to ai tɛma, ka kɛ jusu ni hankili kelen dɔ. <verse eid="PHP 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 2:3" />Ai kana foyi kɛ kɔrɔndiya rɔ wala jɛrɛdabaya rɔ, kɔni ai ye ai jɛrɛ majii, ka doilu jate ka tamin ai jɛrɛ la. <verse eid="PHP 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 2:4" />Ai kana ai miri ai makoilu gbansan ma fɔɔ doilu fanan ta.<verse eid="PHP 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 2:5" />Ai kɛɲa ye to ai ɲɔɔn tɛma ikomin Ɲenematɔmɔnin, Isa.<verse eid="PHP 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 2:6" />Allaya tɛrɛ ye ale mɛn dɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:6">a ma a miri ko a ri wo lamara a jɛrɛ rɔ.<verse eid="PHP 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 2:7" />Kɔni a ka a ban a jɛrɛ rɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:7">ka a jɛrɛ kɛ jɔn di,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:7">ka to adamadenya ɲa ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:7">A ka adamadenya sɔrɔnni,<verse eid="PHP 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 2:8" />a kolora Alla la kuma kɔrɔ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:8">ka sɔn saya ma haan a gbɔngbɔnda jiri kan.<verse eid="PHP 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 2:9" />Wo le ka a kɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:9">Alla ka a lɔdiya fɔlɔ di a ma gbiliya rɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:9">ka tɔɔ di a ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:9">mɛn ka bon tɔɔ bɛɛ ri,<verse eid="PHP 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 2:10" />kosa mɛnilu bɛɛ ye sankolo rɔ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:10">mɛnilu ye duukolo kan a ni a kɔrɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:10">ii wa Isa tɔɔ mɛn waati mɛn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:10">kunbelen bɛɛ ri ɲɔnkin a kɔrɔ,<verse eid="PHP 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 2:11" />nɛn bɛɛ ri a latɛɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:11">ko Ɲenematɔmɔnin Isa le Maari ri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:11">Fa Alla gbiliya ko rɔ.<verse eid="PHP 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ai ye mɛlɛn ikomin kɛnɛya dunuɲa rɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 2:12" />Wo rɔ, n kaninteilu, ai dorinnin n na kuma mirala ɲa mɛn ma n ɲakɔrɔ, ai ye a mira n kɔma fanan ka tamin wo la ten, ka to ai la kisi ko lakanbalila silan ni yɛrɛyɛrɛ rɔ. <verse eid="PHP 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 2:13" />Baa Alla le baarala ai rɔ, kosa ai wɔnike ni ai kɛwaliilu ye bɛn a diyanan ko ma.<verse eid="PHP 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 2:14" />Ai ye ko bɛɛ kɛ hali ai kana a kɛ dalakasili ni ko masɔsɔli rɔ, <verse eid="PHP 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 2:15" />kosa ai ye kɛ sɔn tɛ mɛnilu la, ka sɛninya. Ai ye kɛ Alla denilu ri, fɛɛ tɛ mɛnilu la, mɛnilu ye mɛlɛnna ikomin loloilu sankolo rɔ farɔkɛ telenbali ni sɛninyabaliilu tɛma, <verse eid="PHP 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 2:16" />ai ri kɛ nii lakisi kuma lasela tuma mɛn na, kosa n ye n waso ai la Ɲenematɔmɔnin na lon ko n na dunuɲaratɛɛ ni n na baara kɛni tɛ ko fuu ri.<verse eid="PHP 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 2:17" />Hali ni n faara ai yɛ, ka kɛ ikomin minninfen saraka mɛn ye latɔnna ai la ko rɔ, ka la ai la lemɛniya baara kan Alla ɲakɔrɔ mɛn fanan kɛni ikomin saraka, wo rɔ n di sɛwa wo fanan dɔ ai ri sɛwa nde tɔrɔfɛ. <verse eid="PHP 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 2:18" />Ai fanan ye sɛwa wo ɲa ma, ka to an ɲɔɔn fɛ sɛwa rɔ.<verse eid="PHP 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Timɔte ni Epaforodite la ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 2:19" />N jii lani Maari Isa rɔ ko, n di Timote lawa ai ma jonna, kosa nde jɛrɛ ri jususuma ɲa mɛn ma ai la kibaroilu la ko rɔ. <verse eid="PHP 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 2:20" />Mɔɔ gbɛrɛ tɛ n bolo mɛn hamini ai la ko rɔ ikomin ale. <verse eid="PHP 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 2:21" />Baa bɛɛ ye tɔnɔ le dɔrɔn ɲininna ii jɛrɛ yɛ. Ii tɛ Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin ta ɲininna. <verse eid="PHP 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 2:22" />Kɔni ai jɛrɛ ka a lɔn ko Timɔte ra a kɛɲa yiraka, ka a jɛrɛ kɛ Kibaro Ɲuma baaraden di n tɔrɔfɛ ikomin dencɛ ni a fa. <verse eid="PHP 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 2:23" />N ye a fɛ ka a lawa ai ma, n wa n na koilu yen gbɛni waati mɛn na. <verse eid="PHP 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 2:24" />N lani a la Maari baraka rɔ ko n fanan jɛrɛ ri wa ai tɔrɔfɛ jonna.<verse eid="PHP 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 2:25" />N da a miri ko a fɛrɛ tɛ ye fɔɔ n ye badenma Epaforodite lasɛ ai ma ikɔ tuun, n baaraɲɔɔ ni n kɛlɛkɛɲɔɔ, ai ka mɛn nana n ma, ai fenilu di a ma n dɛmɛn ko rɔ. <verse eid="PHP 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 2:26" />Ai bɛɛ yen lɔɔ ye a la kosɛbɛ! A ra kunnagboya baa ai ra a la jankarɔ la ko mɛn. <verse eid="PHP 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 2:27" />Tuɲa le a ri, a jankarɔra le fewu! A tɛrɛ tonin dɔɔnin a ye faa. Kɔni Alla kininkininda a ma. A ma kininkinin a kelen ma, kɔni nde fanan, kosa wo sunun kana la n na tɔrɔya kan. <verse eid="PHP 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 2:28" />Wo le rɔ, n ye a fɛ ka a lawa ai ma jonna kosa ai wa a yen waati mɛn na, ai ye sɛwa, n jusu fanan ye la dɔɔnin. <verse eid="PHP 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 2:29" />Ai ye a lasɛnɛ sɛwa ba rɔ Maari tɔɔ rɔ. Ai ye wo mɔɔ su gbiliya, <verse eid="PHP 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 2:30" />baa a tɛrɛ ye faala le Ɲenematɔmɔnin na baara la ko rɔ. A tɛrɛ sɔnni a nii di ko rɔ kosa a ye n dɛmɛn ai le jɛrɛ tɛrɛ ti se mɛn kɛla.<verse eid="PHP 2:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PHP 3" />
  <para style="s">Kisi sɔrɔn ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 3:1" />Sisɛn, n badenmailu, aile ye sɛwa Maari la! Wo tɛ n tɔrɔ ni n kɔsɛra wo koilu ma n tɛrɛ ra mɛnilu sɛbɛ ai ma kosa wo ye ai latanka. <verse eid="PHP 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 3:2" />Aile ye ai mataa wo wuluilu la, wo kojuu kɛlailu la, wo mɔɔilu la mɛnilu ye a magbɛlɛnyala wuya rɔ ko ni mɔɔ ma faaninta kɛ a tɛ kisila. <verse eid="PHP 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 3:3" />Adon, andeilu le ra faaninta bɛrɛ kɛ, andeilu mɛnilu ye Alla batola a la Nii Sɛniman baraka rɔ, andeilu mɛnilu ye an wasola Ɲenematɔmɔnin Isa la ko rɔ, andeilu mɛnilu lani tɛ an jɛrɛ faribanku la.<verse eid="PHP 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 3:4" />Ni n ye a fɛ, n fanan di se lala n jɛrɛ faribanku la. Ni doilu mirini ko ii ri la ii jɛrɛ faribanku la, n taminni woilu la paaɔn! <verse eid="PHP 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 3:5" />Ka a masɔrɔn n ka faaninta kɛ n sɔrɔn tele seyinna lon de ma. Isirayɛlika le n di, ka bɔ Bɛniyaminu kabila rɔ, Heburuilu la Heburu le nde ri. N fanan tɛrɛ bilanin sariya kɔfɛ Farisi mɔɔilu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">3.5</char> <char style="fk">Farisi mɔɔilu:</char> Judiyailu le tɛrɛ mɔɔ ɲinilu ri mɛnilu bɛnma ko tɛrɛ a ri, ii ye dina mira ɲa kelen ma. Iile le ka ii sɛɛbɛ don Musa la sariya mira ma ka tamin Judiya doilu la. Ii tɛrɛ ye ii benbailu fanan na namunilu mirala gbɛlɛnman na. Iile tɛrɛ lani mɛlɛkailu la. Ii lani tɛrɛ a la ko mɔɔilu ri wuli saya rɔ.</note> kɛɲa ma. <verse eid="PHP 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 3:6" />Judiya dina komɛ le tɛrɛ n di haan n tɛrɛ ye lemɛniya jama ɲakankatanna. Fɛɛ si tɛrɛ tɛ n na telenna sariya fan fɛ. <verse eid="PHP 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 3:7" />Kɔni n tun da fen mɛnilu jate tɔnɔ ri, sisɛn n ye woilu jatela bɔnɔ ri Ɲenematɔmɔnin na ko rɔ. <verse eid="PHP 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 3:8" />Kɔni n ye koilu bɛɛ jatela bɔnɔ le ri fisamantɛ ɲin na ko rɔ mɛn kɛni Ɲenematɔmɔnin lɔn ko ri, Isa n Maari. Ka a masɔrɔn n da bɔnɔ ko bɛɛ rɔ a la ko rɔ. N da fen bɛɛ jate bɔɔ ri kosa n ye Ɲenematɔmɔnin sɔrɔn, <verse eid="PHP 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 3:9" />ka yen ale rɔ. N tɛ n jɛrɛ kɛla mɔɔ telenni ri n na sariya mira fɛ, kɔni fo lemɛniya baraka rɔ Ɲenematɔmɔnin ma. Telenbaya le wo ri mɛn bɔni Alla rɔ ka a sɔrɔn lemɛniya baraka rɔ. <verse eid="PHP 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 3:10" />N ye a fɛ sinɛn ka Isa lɔn, a ni fanka mɛn ka a lawuli ka bɔ saya rɔ, an ni ale ye tɔrɔya kelen di, ka kɛ ikomin ale a la saya rɔ <verse eid="PHP 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 3:11" />kosa n fanan ye wuli saya rɔ.<verse eid="PHP 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bori haan a dan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 3:12" />N ma ban wo bɛɛ sɔrɔnna fɔlɔ, ni wo tɛ n tɛrɛ ri dafa. Kɔni n dajani a ɲinin diya kosa n ye n kɔndɔn namira baa Ɲenematɔmɔnin Isa le ka n fanan namira. <verse eid="PHP 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 3:13" />Nba, n badenmailu, n ka a lɔn, n ma a sɔrɔn fɔlɔ. Kɔni n ye ko kelen de kɛla sisɛn: ko mɛnilu ye n kɔfɛ, n ye ɲinala woilu ko. Mɛn ye n ɲɛrɔ, n ye karanna se ko rɔ wo le ma ten. <verse eid="PHP 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 3:14" />N ye n borila, kosa n ye wa se a dan ma, ka n kɔndɔn sɔrɔn, Alla ka n kili mɛn ma Ɲenematɔmɔnin Isa baraka rɔ.<verse eid="PHP 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 3:15" />Wo le rɔ, andeilu mɛnilu ra kɔɔ lemɛniya rɔ, a ka kan an bɛɛ ye wo yen wo ɲa le ma. Kɔni ni ko gbɛrɛ ye ai le do kɔndɔ, Alla ri wo fanan nagbɛ wo tii yɛ. <verse eid="PHP 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 3:16" />Wo rɔ, an kun lɔni yɔrɔ mɛn na, an ye wa ɲɛfɛ wo ɲa le ma.<verse eid="PHP 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 3:17" />N badenmailu, ai bɛɛ ye nde ladɛn. Mɔɔ mɛnilu taama ɲa kɛni ikomin an ta, woilu le ye kɛ misali ri ai yɛ. <verse eid="PHP 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 3:18" />N tɛrɛ ra ɲin fɔ ai yɛ siɲa siyaman, n kasitɔla ye a fɔla ai yɛ sisɛn fanan. Mɔɔ siyaman tamanɲa ka ii kɛ juuilu ri Ɲenematɔmɔnin na gbɔngbɔn jiri<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">3.18</char> Romukailu ye mɔɔilu gbɔngbɔnna <char style="fk">Jiri</char> le ma, ka ii faa. Isa la saya le ɲenemaya banbali lakisi dila mɔɔilu ma, ka a faa jiri kɛ kisi tɔɔmasere ri.</note> kan. <verse eid="PHP 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 3:19" />Wo mɔɔilu ye ii labanna jahanama le rɔ. Ii la alla le ii kɔnɔrɔ natailu ri. Ii la waso ye ii la kɔsɔ koilu le rɔ. Ii mirini dunuɲa koilu ma dɔrɔn. <verse eid="PHP 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 3:20" />Kɔni harijeene duurenilu le andeilu ri. An ye an nakisila le makɔnɔla ka bɔ harijeene, an Maari Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin. <verse eid="PHP 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 3:21" />A ri an faribanku fankatan yɛlɛman, ii ri to gbiliya rɔ ikomin ale, a ri a kɛ fanka la mɛn di se ko bɛɛ lala a fanka kɔrɔ.<verse eid="PHP 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PHP 4" />
  <para style="s">Pɔli la lalili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 4:1" />Wo le rɔ, n badenmailu, n kaninteilu n lɔɔ ye mɛnilu la, mɛnilu kɛnin sɛwa ni kunnafulen di n yɛ, ai ye to Maari rɔ gben gben ɲa mɛn ma, n kaninteilu.<verse eid="PHP 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 4:2" />Ewodi ni Sintiki, n ye ai madiyala, ai bɛn ai ɲɔɔn ma Maari rɔ. <verse eid="PHP 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 4:3" />Ile, n baaraɲɔɔ, landaya mɔɔ, n da i madiya, i ye wo musoilu dɛmɛn ka a masɔrɔn ii ra baara bakɛ n tɔrɔfɛ Isa la ko Kibaro Ɲuma la ko rɔ, wo ni Kelementi ni n duɲɔɔilu bɛɛ mɛnilu tɔɔilu sɛbɛni harijeene don kitabu kɔndɔ.<verse eid="PHP 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 4:4" />Ai ye sɛwa Maari la ko rɔ waati bɛɛ. N ye a fɔ fanan, ai ye sɛwa. <verse eid="PHP 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 4:5" />Mɔɔ bɛɛ ye a lɔn ko ai sabarini. Maari natɔla le sisɛn! <verse eid="PHP 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 4:6" />Ai kana hamin foyi la, kɔni ai ye ai makoilu fɔ Alla matara diya a ni baraka bila rɔ fen bɛɛ rɔ waati bɛɛ. <verse eid="PHP 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 4:7" />Nba, Alla ye jususuma mɛn dila, hankili foyi ti se a famunna, wo ri ai jusu ni ai miriya lakandan Ɲenematɔmɔnin Isa rɔ.<verse eid="PHP 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 4:8" />Nba, tɔɔla, n badenmailu, ko mɛn di kɛ tuɲa ri, ko bɛrɛ, telen, sɛninya, ladiyaɲɛ, gbiliya ye ko mɛn dɔ, ni sɔn ɲuma le a ri, mɛn ka kan ka tandoli sɔrɔn, woilu ye kɛ ai miriyailu ri. <verse eid="PHP 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 4:9" />Ai ra karan mɛnilu sɔrɔn n na, ai ra mɛn namɛn n na wala ka a yen n kɛwaliilu rɔ, ai ye woilu kɛ. Wo rɔ, Alla la jususuma ri to ai fɛ.<verse eid="PHP 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔli la baraka bila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 4:10" />N sɛwani Maari la ko rɔ kosɛbɛ baa ai ra ai janto n dɔ ikɔ tuun. Ai hamini tɛrɛ ye n yɛ fewu kɔni ai ma fɛrɛ sɔrɔn ai ye a yiraka n na. <verse eid="PHP 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 4:11" />N tɛ ɲin fɔla ai yɛ n mako la ko rɔ, baa n da karan ka wasa kɛɲa su bɛɛ ma. <verse eid="PHP 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 4:12" />N da bolokolonya lɔn, n da dabundɛ lɔn. N da gbundu sɔrɔn ka wasa yɔrɔ bɛɛ ni waati bɛɛ, ni n fani wala ni n dɛsɛni, ni fen siyaman ye n bolo wala dɔɔni, baa <verse eid="PHP 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 4:13" />n di se ko bɛɛ kɛla Isa baraka rɔ mɛn ye fanka dila n ma.<verse eid="PHP 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 4:14" />Kɔni hali wo, ai ra koɲuma kɛ ka n dɛmɛn n na tɔrɔyailu rɔ. <verse eid="PHP 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 4:15" />Aile Filipikailu fanan jɛrɛ ka a lɔn, ai ka Isa la ko Kibaro Ɲuma la ko mɛn waati mɛn na, n bɔtɔla Masedoni, aile le dɔrɔn ka sanba lana n ma lemɛniya jamailu tɛma. <verse eid="PHP 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 4:16" />Fanan, n tɛrɛ ye Tesaloniki so kɔndɔ waati mɛn na, siɲa fila, ai ka sanbailu lana n ma n mako tɛrɛ ye mɛnilu la. <verse eid="PHP 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 4:17" />N tɛ sanbali ɲininna n jɛrɛ yɛ, kɔni n ye a fɛ le ai ri ai kɔndɔn sɔrɔn. <verse eid="PHP 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 4:18" />Ai ka fen mɛnilu bɛɛ don Epaforodite bolo, n da ii bɛɛ masɔrɔn, woilu ra n makoilu bɛɛ ɲa, ka n wasa. A kɛnin de ikomin wusulan mɛn ye janinna saraka ɲuma ri, mɛn ka Alla hɛnɛ. <verse eid="PHP 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 4:19" />Wo rɔ, n na Alla ri ai dɛmɛn ai mako bɛɛ rɔ a la dabundɛ rɔ Ɲenematɔmɔnin Isa baraka rɔ. <verse eid="PHP 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 4:20" />An ye gbiliya di an Fa Alla ma habadan haan habadan. Amina.<verse eid="PHP 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tuwali laban</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 4:21" />Ai ye jama sɛniman bɛɛ tuwa mɛnilu ye Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin dɔ. An badenma mɛnilu ye n tɔrɔfɛ yan, woilu fanan ye ai tuwala. <verse eid="PHP 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 4:22" />Jama sɛniman mɛn bɛɛ ye yan, woilu ye ai tuwala, katarabi Romu Mansaba wara mɔɔilu ma.<verse eid="PHP 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 4:23" />Maari Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin na hina ye to ai rɔ.<verse eid="PHP 4:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 4" />
</usx>